      "contextFingerprint": "c0fca21c635b9fb1006fb2500306db39102c5f58b19cfb3bd704749267cb313b",
      "sourceText": "1.  拉取镜像：\n\n      ROS+OpenCV4.11+CUDA12.8+CuDNN9.7.0：\n\n      （因为50系显卡最低要跑CUDA12.8,所以拉高门槛）\n\n    使用以下带有CUDA和CuDNN的Docker必须满足的条件:\n\n    1.  有英伟达NVIDIA独立显卡\n\n    2.  显卡驱动必须满足≥570.86.10\n\n    3.  设备的架构必须为amd64(x86_64)架构或者aarch64(arm64)架构。(绝大多数设备均满足)\n\n    4.  cv_bridge(amd64支持，但arm64暂时没构建，请自行构建)\n\n    5.  支持的显卡型号如下:\n\n        1.  GTX10系列桌面端、移动端显卡均已支持\n\n        2.  RTX20-RTX50系列桌面端、移动端显卡均已支持\n\n        3.  NVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin、NVIDIA Jetson Orin NX、NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano工控机已支持\n\n        4.  NVIDIA Jetson AGX Xavier、NVIDIA Jetson Xavier NX工控机已支持\n\n        5.  其他显卡均未适配，强行使用其他显卡肯定会有不兼容的问题，如果想要适配你的显卡型号，请单独联系学长\n\n      暂时主要维护ROS Humble的版本，其他版本随缘更新，但也基本都是非常够用的状态随着战队主要使用的版本而变化）",
      "translatedText": "1.  Pull image:\n\n      ROS+OpenCV4.11+CUDA12.8+CuDNN9.7.0:\n\n      (Since the 50 series GPUs require at least CUDA12.8 to run, the threshold has been raised\\.)\n\n    The following conditions must be met to use the Docker with CUDA and cuDNN:\n\n    1.  Have an NVIDIA discrete GPU\n\n    2.  The GPU driver must be ≥570\\.86\\.10\n\n    3.  The device architecture must be amd64 (x86_64) or aarch64 (arm64)\\. (Most devices meet this requirement\\.)\n\n    4.  cv_bridge (amd64 is supported, but arm64 has not been built yet; please build it yourself\\.)\n\n    5.  The supported GPU models are as follows:\n\n        1.  GTX 10 series desktop and mobile GPUs are both supported\\.\n\n        2.  RTX20-RTX50 series desktop and mobile GPUs are both supported\\.\n\n        3.  NVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin, NVIDIA Jetson Orin NX, and NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano industrial PCs are supported\\.\n\n        4.  NVIDIA Jetson AGX Xavier and NVIDIA Jetson Xavier NX industrial PCs are supported\\.\n\n        5.  Other GPUs are not adapted; forcibly using other GPUs will definitely cause incompatibility issues\\. If you want your GPU model to be adapted, please contact the senior student separately\\.\n\n      Currently, the ROS Humble version is mainly maintained; other versions are updated as time permits, but they are generally in a very usable state and change with the version mainly used by the team\\.)",
